 " of all symbolic differential forms or wedge-products in the elements of \
the list ",
 StyleBox["x",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". Independent here means not equal to  \[PlusMinus]  a numerical multiple \
of another coefficient. "
}], "Text",
