Cell["\<\
Setting the d[x] equal to their expressions in terms of the e[a] makes \
calculations involving differentiations in this frame more efficient. \
However, if a subsequent calculation in a different frame is to be carried \
out, these values must be cleared. This can be done by evaluating:\
\>", "Text",
 FontSize->16,
 CellTags->"sec 5"],

