performed, the differentials of the coordinates (and of the symbol dx) must \
be cleared before each new calculation.This is accomplished with the command ",
 StyleBox["Clear$dx",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "  - see section 5.1.1 \"",
 ButtonBox["Note on repeated frame calculations",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData:>"sec 5"],
 "\"."
}], "Text",
 FontSize->16],

