     15 b^2 m \[ScriptD][t]^2 - 2 b^5 \[ScriptD][\[Theta]]^2 + 
     2 b^5 Sin[\[Theta]]^2 \[ScriptD][\[CurlyPhi]]^2)}, -2, 4, 1]]], "Output"]
}, Open  ]],

